{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25874","headline":"华山庆云见 · 李绅","name":"华山庆云见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣主祠名岳，高峰发庆云。\n金柯初缭绕，玉叶渐氛氲。\n气色含珠日，晴光吐翠雰。\n依稀来鹤态，髣髴列仙羣。\n万树流光影，千潭写锦文。\n苍生欣有望，祥瑞在吾君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}